      "text": "# Orchestration API\n\nFastAPI Application\n`orchestration/main.py`\n\nEndpoints:\n- `GET /` - Web UI\n- `POST /ingest` - Ingest CSV\n- `POST /ask` - RAG query\n- `POST /ask_direct` - Direct LLM",
